GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "B33F268D7D624395"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{918D01E5CF028A26}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "A major insurgent force is preparing to assault an Iraqi Army checkpoint north of Al-Hadra. The position controls a key stretch of highway that insurgent forces need secured in order to move men and equipment through the region freely."\
     "Outnumbered Iraqi defenders are expected to face a heavy attack as both sides fight for control of the route."\
     ""\
     "<b>Reference mission notes for restrictions</b>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3C018853EB29902F}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 24/07/2013, 1300hr, Al-Hadra, Iraq."\
     "Weather: Clear, no forecast of change, sightlines 1km+"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Large parts of Iraq have fallen into chaos as insurgent groups continue to seize territory across the region. Iraqi forces, weakened by years of fighting and heavy losses in both men and equipment, have struggled to contain the growing insurgency."\
     "North of Al-Hadra, a key highway checkpoint remains under Iraqi control, disrupting insurgent movement through the area. Intelligence reports indicate a large insurgent force is preparing to attack and eliminate the garrison stationed there in order to secure unrestricted access along the highway."\
     "The checkpoint is isolated and expected to come under heavy assault. Both sides understand the importance of the position — whoever controls the highway controls movement through the region."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AFDE52C6832C9429}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 24/07/2013, 1300hr, Al-Hadra, Iraq."\
     "Weather: Clear, no forecast of change, sightlines 1km+"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Large parts of Iraq have fallen into chaos as insurgent groups continue to seize territory across the region. Iraqi forces, weakened by years of fighting and heavy losses in both men and equipment, have struggled to contain the growing insurgency."\
     "North of Al-Hadra, a key highway checkpoint remains under Iraqi control, disrupting insurgent movement through the area. Intelligence reports indicate a large insurgent force is preparing to attack and eliminate the garrison stationed there in order to secure unrestricted access along the highway."\
     "The checkpoint is isolated and expected to come under heavy assault. Both sides understand the importance of the position — whoever controls the highway controls movement through the region."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A685ABC5326ED331}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of regular Iraqi light infantry, approximately 25 personnel strong, currently garrisoning the fortified northern checkpoint at GRID: 038069."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• The checkpoint is heavily fortified, featuring high HESCO walls, manned tower bunkers along the perimeter, and razor wire covering both road entrances. Additional fortified fighting positions are established throughout the compound, on surrounding buildings, and along the access road."\
     "Weapon systems include NSV, KORD, PKM, a single mortar, and Kornet ATGM positions, all sighted to cover the surrounding terrain. Iraqi forces regularly rotate weapon placements, making patterns difficult to predict."\
     "The checkpoint maintains clear all-round observation, with minimal cover or concealment within 300 metres."\
     "• 2x .50 cal Humvees have been identified and are used for defence, transport, and general duties around the checkpoint."\
     "• Enemy forces are expected to be well armed and well supplied with ammunition. The checkpoint was last attacked the previous month and has since had time to rearm and reinforce."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C393EAB8BAF13DE6}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "We are the fighters of Briza Troop, Sundown Company.  "\
     "Our force consists of approximately 50 personnel currently located within the city of Al-Hadra at GRID: 039043, with an additional 14 fighters en route.  "\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• 1x unarmed BRDM (seperate from the rest of vehicles) with explosives for use as a VBIED. One volunteer will be selected for the attack."\
     "The driver may detonate the explosives manually from the dashboard or enable a deadman’s switch."\
     "• We possess a range of armed vehicles, including:"\
     "2x captured armoured Humvees, one with a BMP turret and another with a BTR turret."\
     "3x soft-skin PKM UAZs"\
     "1x captured soft-skin .50 cal Humvee"\
     "2x 7.62 front-mounted technical"\
     ""\
     "We also have:  "\
     "1x unarmed M113  "\
     "1x unarmed armoured Humvee  "\
     "2x unarmed BRDMs"\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• 14 additional fighters are currently moving toward the staging area. They will reinforce our numbers if casualties are sustained.  "\
     "• We have access to approximately 30 motorcycles and 20 civilian vehicles for transport, from cars, wagons, and trucks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{412643513AF16A29}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "Enemy forces consist of hardened Islamic insurgents.  "\
     "Estimated strength is approximately 70 personnel.  "\
     "Their current central location is unknown, though they are believed to be spread throughout Al-Hadra and staging for operations within the area.  "\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>  "\
     "• High morale - Following a string of victories, enemy morale remains high. Fighters are expected to engage aggressively and with little regard for casualties.  "\
     "• High mobility - The insurgents have access to a wide range of civilian and military vehicles, including BMPs, T-72/T-64/T-55 tanks, armed technicals, and captured Iraqi equipment such as M113s and Humvees.  "\
     "• Regularly known to employ VBIEDs and suicide bombers during assaults and defensive actions."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E901DBD3A2EC9DF7}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "We are Iraqi Army forces from 4th Platoon, Sharaf Company.  "\
     "Currently established within our fortified checkpoint north of Al-Hadra city, GRID:  038069"\
     "We have order to stay within the marked circle and not push further if we choose to leave the CP."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>  "\
     "• 2x .50 cal Humvees positioned along the highway at either end of the checkpoint."\
     "• Several static turrets covering the checkpoint perimeter.  "\
     "We have 1x Kornet ATGM with 3x missiles located in the eastern tower bunker, alongside various heavy and light machine guns positioned around the perimeter and on buildings. Reference map for exact locations.  "\
     "We can move these if we wish, but highly not recommend. Placement will be hard and the current postions are sighted."\
     "There is also an 82mm mortar with 40x HE, 25x Smokes, 15x Illum."\
     "• Our checkpoint contains multiple fortified fighting positions, with the ability to engage directly from the perimeter walls."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>  "\
     "A supply crate is available inside the white building next to our starting position.  "\
     "It contains:  "\
     "• 6x PG-7VL | 2x TBG-7V | 3x OG-7V rockets.  "\
     "• 10x 100rnd PKM | 10x 100rnd M240 boxes.  "\
     "• Roughly 100x magazines across various rifles."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{52E79EBA858913C4}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>  "\
     "We are to conduct a DELIBERATE ASSAULT on the Iraqi checkpoint in order to SECURE it by OCCUPYING the position and DESTROYING the garrisoned forces.  "\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>  "\
     "Securing this checkpoint is critical to our freedom of movement within the region. Its capture will open the northern highway in and out of Al-Hadra, allowing the movement of men, vehicles, and supplies through the area.  "\
     ""\
     "We shall without fear assault into the checkpoint, occupy it with our presence within the perminter, and destroy the Iraqi troops by slaughtering them, mashallah!\""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{94A640E974F32336}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "Our mission is to hold to the checkpoint at all costs and repel the imminent Insurgent attack."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
